# This module's native code never uses Zygisk's companion-process
# mechanism (classes.dex is read directly off disk while still root, see
# customize.sh), so no custom policy is strictly required for how it works
# today. Left in place as a harmless, zero-cost safety net - some custom
# ROMs ship base policy that's stricter than AOSP around zygote-adjacent
# processes in ways unrelated to this module specifically. Each line below
# is applied as a raw policy statement by KernelSU; see
# https://kernelsu.org/guide/module.html for the format.
allow zygote self:capability sys_ptrace
